DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
17700::$$$message_0133_0000_0000$$$::There are no people by the riverside for a change.[lr]::
17701::$$$message_0133_0000_0001$$$::There are only two people at the most beloved spot for relaxation in the city.[lr]::
17702::$$$message_0133_0000_0002$$$::A rare pairing that obviously stands out.::
17703::$$$message_0133_0001_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=1000][say storage=cty0419_shi_0000 name=士郎]How rare."[lr]::
17704::$$$message_0133_0001_0001$$$::No, it's not just the pairing that's rare.[lr]::
17705::$$$message_0133_0001_0002$$$::They're originally like cat and dog; if they didn't have the same Master, they would kill each other first thing, but they're eating ice cream together while chatting...!::
17706::$$$message_0133_0002_0000$$$::"Oh, it's on me this time."[lr]::
17707::$$$message_0133_0002_0001$$$::And a shocking truth is revealed.[lr]::
17708::$$$message_0133_0002_0002$$$::"Hahaha. Man, Berry Berry Strong is the best ice cream flavor after all!"[lr]::
17709::$$$message_0133_0002_0003$$$::Additionally, a useless opinion is also revealed.[lr]::
17710::$$$message_0133_0002_0004$$$::By the way, what Lancer is eating is strawberry flavored gelato.::
17711::$$$message_0133_0003_0000$$$::"Oh, Mister is shocked.[lr]::
17712::$$$message_0133_0003_0001$$$::Is it weird for me and him to be together?"[lr]::
17713::$$$message_0133_0003_0002$$$::"Well, it is actually weird. It's natural for the kid to freeze up."::
17714::$$$message_0133_0004_0000$$$::"First of all, it's weird for you to even be remotely lovable.[lr]::
17715::$$$message_0133_0004_0001$$$::You're a totally different person. There's too many mysteries in your growth process. It's even more of a blank space than from an ape to a person."::
17716::$$$message_0133_0005_0000$$$::"Oh? I really am disliked. I want to get along as those who have the same Master.[lr]::
17717::$$$message_0133_0005_0001$$$::Well, looking back, it can't be helped since I've been doing a ton of things that would cause a misunderstanding."::
17718::$$$message_0133_0006_0000$$$::"You ain't causing any misunderstandings. That's totally acting like a tyrant. There ain't nothing good about it no matter how you look at it. [cacheimage storage=ランサーアロハ01b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ランサーアロハ01b(中)]You wouldn't be able to mend your ways unless you destroy it and fix it from the root."[cacheimage storage=020_溜息][wvs][fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=480 index=2000 top=270 time=100 storage=020_溜息]::
17719::$$$message_0133_0007_0000$$$::"That is true. I wonder why I turned into such an adult. But I can't change the future. Ahh, is it this depressing to know the future?"[lr]::
17720::$$$message_0133_0007_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ランサーアロハ01c(中)]The blond child drops his shoulders in disappointment.::
17721::$$$message_0133_0008_0000$$$::"I understand. I can kinda get how you feel."[lr]::
17722::$$$message_0133_0008_0001$$$::"Really? I'm glad, I'll be able to get along with you then.[lr]::
17723::$$$message_0133_0008_0002$$$::I'm happy, I finally met someone that could become friends with me even when I grow up!"[lr]::
17724::$$$message_0133_0008_0003$$$::"Oh. Sorry, that's not possible. I can't get along with the grown-up you. We fundamentally have different tastes."::
17725::$$$message_0133_0009_0000$$$::"I see... I'm in shock. So you're also saying, with a straight face, that you prefer me as a kid... How twisted of you to say that I'm not your taste once I grow up."::
17726::$$$message_0133_0010_0000$$$::"...Mrgh. Kid, are you one of those kinds of people?[cacheimage storage=ランサーアロハ01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ランサーアロハ01a(中)] ...I see, so that's why. [cacheimage storage=ランサーアロハ01g(中)b][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ランサーアロハ01g(中)b]Well, I did think it was weird that you summoned a little kid out of the many Heroic Spirits of the sword."::
17727::$$$message_0133_0011_0000$$$::"A-AS IF!!!!![lr]::
17728::$$$message_0133_0011_0001$$$::My interests have always been respectable! Don't lump me in with that Goldy with weird preferences!!!!!"[lr]::
17729::$$$message_0133_0011_0002$$$::"How rude. I don't want to be told that by you.[lr]::
17730::$$$message_0133_0011_0003$$$::You became a felon from the moment that you blushed at Illya in her swimsuit."::
17731::$$$message_0133_0012_0000$$$::"Guh, why do you know that, (young) King of Heroes...!!![lr]::
17732::$$$message_0133_0012_0001$$$::Well, um, however, this matter and that matter are completely separate. First of all, Saber isn't a little kid."[lr]::
17733::$$$message_0133_0012_0002$$$::Unfortunately.::
17734::$$$message_0133_0013_0000$$$::"Huh? She's enough of a kid. Compared to Rider, I think she's more like a young girl than a woman."[lr]::
17735::$$$message_0133_0013_0001$$$::"Shh, that is not good, Lancer. You'll be turning Rider into an enemy with that wild remark, too."[lr]::
17736::$$$message_0133_0013_0002$$$::"Agreed. Please don't say something too scary, Lancer. A rocket might come flying here from over there if you say something wrong."::
17737::$$$message_0133_0014_0000$$$::"Over there? Over where?"[lr]::
17738::$$$message_0133_0014_0001$$$::"I said over there. I can also call one with a Command Spell, though."::
17739::$$$message_0133_0015_0000$$$::"Don't call one! That's a missile, not a rocket!"[lr]::
17740::$$$message_0133_0015_0001$$$::"Ahaha, and a nuclear one at that."[lr]::
17741::$$$message_0133_0015_0002$$$::"Yeah. That's what you call giving a knife to a madman. That mistress is merciless towards her enemies."::
17742::$$$message_0133_0016_0000$$$::The blond child laughs, and Mr. Aloha Shirt shrugs his shoulders.[lr]::
17743::$$$message_0133_0016_0001$$$::[font italic=true]......Hmm.[font italic=false][lr]::
17744::$$$message_0133_0016_0002$$$::It must also be because it's at the park on a weekend, but isn't this pairing pretty heartwarming?::
17745::$$$message_0133_0017_0000$$$::"So. What are you two doing here?"[lr]::
17746::$$$message_0133_0017_0001$$$::Mr. Aloha Shirt makes a blatantly disgusted face.[lr]::
17747::$$$message_0133_0017_0002$$$::The blond child looks away sadly.::
17748::$$$message_0133_0018_0000$$$::"That's unlike you guys. It's rare for you guys to be reluctant about something.[lr]::
17749::$$$message_0133_0018_0001$$$::...Oh, could it be related to the Holy Grail War?"::
17750::$$$message_0133_0019_0000$$$::"Hah, don't be ridiculous, as if I would worry about something like the battle. There's a different cause for this headache. Compared to this worry, the Holy Grail War would be in the fun category."[lr]::
17751::$$$message_0133_0019_0001$$$::"...Hmm, it's the opposite for me. Compared to participating in the Holy Grail War, well, I can endure it enough..."::
17752::$$$message_0133_0020_0000$$$::"You think so? Compared to that insidiousness, a head-on fight is better. You also prefer a physical battle, right? Since you're the type to make it clear where you stand, win or lose, more than me."::
17753::$$$message_0133_0021_0000$$$::"A physical battle isn't smart. If possible, I would like to win without fighting, [cacheimage storage=ギル子供01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ギル子供01d(中)]but well, putting aside our differences in strategy and tactics...[lr]::
17754::$$$message_0133_0021_0001$$$::If you want me to make things clear, then let me tell you this: that person is straightforward, Lancer. There's no hesitation in their plan."::
17755::$$$message_0133_0022_0000$$$::"That depends on the plan. Not hesitating to push people around is a questionable trait for someone to have."[lr]::
17756::$$$message_0133_0022_0001$$$::"I think it's questionable, but isn't it fine for someone who leads others?"::
17757::$$$message_0133_0023_0000$$$::"Well, that's not for me, though.[lr]::
17758::$$$message_0133_0023_0001$$$::Kings should have the same outlook as everyone else, aside from his own."::
17759::$$$message_0133_0024_0000$$$::"Wow, how splendid.[lr]::
17760::$$$message_0133_0024_0001$$$::...Yo, kid. This is changing the subject, but there's a super selfish king that I know.[lr]::
17761::$$$message_0133_0024_0002$$$::He looks down on every other human, calling them mongrels, thinks it's natural for everything in this world to serve him, yet hates humans who become just like that. Do you know him?"::
17762::$$$message_0133_0025_0000$$$::"I do. He doesn't listen to what people have to say, thinks he'll get whatever he wants as long as he pays, and completely forgets the wrongdoings he did the day before.[lr]::
17763::$$$message_0133_0025_0001$$$::He's always running after women and getting dumped almost every day, yet he continues to make passes at them. 'It's not whether you like me or not, it's whether I like you or not; that's everything!' Saying stuff like that."::
17764::$$$message_0133_0026_0000$$$::"Yup. Plus, he doesn't remember the favors that people have done for him.[lr]::
17765::$$$message_0133_0026_0001$$$::Instead of running off without paying off his debt, he thinks the debt is a natural tribute. And plus..."[lr]::
17766::$$$message_0133_0026_0002$$$::"He doesn't work at all for others. He's unemployed. Even though he's fooling around every day, he acts cocky and confiscates the property of people who are properly working."::
17767::$$$message_0133_0027_0000$$$::"Exactly. Such a troublesome guy.[lr]::
17768::$$$message_0133_0027_0001$$$::So. This is off topic, but what do you think about a guy like that?"::
17769::$$$message_0133_0028_0000$$$::There isn't anything to think about.[lr]::
17770::$$$message_0133_0028_0001$$$::From the bottom of his heart, the blond child says...[lr]::
17771::$$$message_0133_0028_0002$$$::"Wow, what a terrible person. Is there actually someone like that!?"[lr]::
17772::$$$message_0133_0028_0003$$$::Yeah, it's you.::
17773::$$$message_0133_0029_0000$$$::"Oh. We were just on the same page, kid."[lr]::
17774::$$$message_0133_0029_0001$$$::"Yeah. If there were other people here, I think everyone would be on the same page."[lr]::
17775::$$$message_0133_0029_0002$$$::The two of us nod.[lr]::
17776::$$$message_0133_0029_0003$$$::The child king gazes at us in wonder.::
17777::$$$message_0133_0030_0000$$$::"So. What are you guys seriously doing here anyway? I have no idea since you guys keep on omitting the main subject."[lr]::
17778::$$$message_0133_0030_0001$$$::"Huh? We were saying we don't want to go back to our hideout."[lr]::
17779::$$$message_0133_0030_0002$$$::"Yes. Our Master is oppressive."[lr]::
17780::$$$message_0133_0030_0003$$$::"Master...?"::
17781::$$$message_0133_0031_0000$$$::Kotomine...isn't their Master.[lr]::
17782::$$$message_0133_0031_0001$$$::He died half a year ago. There's another contractor keeping these two in the current world.[lr]::
17783::$$$message_0133_0031_0002$$$::About what kind of person they are...[lr]::
17784::$$$message_0133_0031_0003$$$::I'm not sure whether I know them or not.::
17785::$$$message_0133_0032_0000$$$::"Wow. What kind of person are they?"[lr]::
17786::$$$message_0133_0032_0001$$$::"We're the ones who want to know. The only thing we know is that they're as reckless when it comes to using Servants as the last one.[lr]::
17787::$$$message_0133_0032_0002$$$::What about you? You're treated with more care than me, right?"::
17788::$$$message_0133_0033_0000$$$::"I don't know the details either.[lr]::
17789::$$$message_0133_0033_0001$$$::All I know is that she was sent from the church to a convent and found her calling there.[lr]::
17790::$$$message_0133_0033_0002$$$::I don't know how to react when she brags about her questionable past."::
17791::$$$message_0133_0034_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17792::$$$message_0133_0034_0001$$$::All right. I'm not able to tell right away what they're talking about, but there's one thing that I can tell in the current situation.[lr]::
17793::$$$message_0133_0034_0002$$$::These two have a mutual nemesis, and their sense of camaraderie is stronger than ever.::
17794::$$$message_0133_0035_0000$$$::"...In other words... You two are running away from your Master?"[lr]::
17795::$$$message_0133_0035_0001$$$::"We're not running away. We're just disappearing so that we don't get any impossible orders again."[lr]::
17796::$$$message_0133_0035_0002$$$::"You have it easy, Lancer. The bind of your Command Spell is weak. Mine is strong, so I get a good scolding just from backing you up a bit."::
17797::$$$message_0133_0036_0000$$$::"Damn, really? That's tough. She would keep us nearby but wouldn't say a word all day.[lr]::
17798::$$$message_0133_0036_0001$$$::Rider might get along with her, but it's a bed of nails for us."::
17799::$$$message_0133_0037_0000$$$::The two are both listless.[lr]::
17800::$$$message_0133_0037_0001$$$::So they're not scared of her ability as a mage, but they don't like her as a person.::
17801::$$$message_0133_0038_0000$$$::"Oh... I just remembered.[lr]::
17802::$$$message_0133_0038_0001$$$::I got captured by a red cloth when I was walking here before. She asked if I saw a suspicious duo around here..."::
17803::$$$message_0133_0039_0000$$$::"See ya, kid. I just remembered something I have to do.[lr]::
17804::$$$message_0133_0039_0001$$$::If the same thing happens to you, tell her you don't know the blue one, but you see the golden one playing here often."::
17805::$$$message_0133_0040_0000$$$::"I can't stay still either.[lr]::
17806::$$$message_0133_0040_0001$$$::If the same thing happens, please tell her that you don't know the golden one, but the blue one is at the port."::
17807::$$$message_0133_0041_0000$$$::The Servants exchange nihilistic glances at each other.[lr]::
17808::$$$message_0133_0041_0001$$$::As expected of soldiers who have survived several battles together.[lr]::
17809::$$$message_0133_0041_0002$$$::No matter how close they are, they're totally trying to kick each other down at the starting line!::
17810::$$$message_0133_0042_0000$$$::"Bye! You also seriously watch out, kid!"[lr]::
17811::$$$message_0133_0042_0001$$$::Lancer runs towards the port.[lr]::
17812::$$$message_0133_0042_0002$$$::"See you.[lr]::
17813::$$$message_0133_0042_0003$$$::Please care for that person when you feel up to it."[lr]::
17814::$$$message_0133_0042_0004$$$::The blond child disappears towards Miyama with a speed that could rival Lancer.::
17815::$$$message_0133_0043_0000$$$::...Now.[lr]::
17816::$$$message_0133_0043_0001$$$::Servants who fool around as they wish, and a Master that forces dull work on them.[lr]::
17817::$$$message_0133_0043_0002$$$::As a third party looking in, I don't know which side has it worse, but...[lr]::
17818::$$$message_0133_0043_0003$$$::"That seems fun as is."[lr]::
17819::$$$message_0133_0043_0004$$$::It's like a new love triangle.::

